      "content": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <cstdio>\n#include <cassert>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <cstdint>\n\n#if defined(__aarch64__)\n#include <arm_neon.h>\n#endif\n\ntypedef std::int64_t Sum;\n\n#if defined(__aarch64__)\nstatic inline int64x2_t maximum_vector(int64x2_t a, int64x2_t b) {\n    return vbslq_s64(vcgtq_s64(a, b), a, b);\n}\n#endif\n\nstatic inline Sum horizontal_maximum(const Sum* column, int n, int s,\n                                     Sum first, Sum best) {\n    Sum sum = first;\n    best = std::max(best, first);\n    int col = s;\n\n#if defined(__aarch64__)\n    const int64x2_t zero = vdupq_n_s64(0);\n    int64x2_t carry = vdupq_n_s64(first);\n    int64x2_t maxima = vdupq_n_s64(best);\n\n    for (; col + 7 < n; col += 8) {\n        const int64x2_t delta01 = vsubq_s64(\n            vld1q_s64(column + col), vld1q_s64(column + col - s));\n        const int64x2_t delta23 = vsubq_s64(\n            vld1q_s64(column + col + 2), vld1q_s64(column + col - s + 2));\n        const int64x2_t delta45 = vsubq_s64(\n            vld1q_s64(column + col + 4), vld1q_s64(column + col - s + 4));\n        const int64x2_t delta67 = vsubq_s64(\n            vld1q_s64(column + col + 6), vld1q_s64(column + col - s + 6));\n\n        int64x2_t prefix01 = vaddq_s64(delta01, vextq_s64(zero, delta01, 1));\n        int64x2_t prefix23 = vaddq_s64(delta23, vextq_s64(zero, delta23, 1));\n        int64x2_t prefix45 = vaddq_s64(delta45, vextq_s64(zero, delta45, 1));\n        int64x2_t prefix67 = vaddq_s64(delta67, vextq_s64(zero, delta67, 1));\n\n        const int64x2_t offset2 = vdupq_laneq_s64(prefix01, 1);\n        const int64x2_t offset4 = vaddq_s64(\n            offset2, vdupq_laneq_s64(prefix23, 1));\n        const int64x2_t offset6 = vaddq_s64(\n            offset4, vdupq_laneq_s64(prefix45, 1));\n        prefix23 = vaddq_s64(prefix23, offset2);\n        prefix45 = vaddq_s64(prefix45, offset4);\n        prefix67 = vaddq_s64(prefix67, offset6);\n\n        const int64x2_t block_maximum = maximum_vector(\n            maximum_vector(prefix01, prefix23),\n            maximum_vector(prefix45, prefix67));\n        maxima = maximum_vector(maxima, vaddq_s64(carry, block_maximum));\n        carry = vaddq_s64(carry, vdupq_laneq_s64(prefix67, 1));\n    }\n\n    sum = vgetq_lane_s64(carry, 0);\n    best = std::max(vgetq_lane_s64(maxima, 0), vgetq_lane_s64(maxima, 1));\n#endif\n\n    for (; col < n; ++col) {\n        sum += column[col] - column[col - s];\n        best = std::max(best, sum);\n    }\n    return best;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int n, s;\n    std::cin >> n >> s;\n    std::vector<std::vector<int> > matrix(n, std::vector<int>(n));\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i)\n        for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j)\n            scanf(\"%d\", &matrix[i][j]);\n\n    assert(s < n);\n    assert(n < 8000);\n    assert(s > 0);\n    assert(n > 0);\n\n    std::vector<Sum> columns(n, 0);\n    Sum* column = columns.data();\n\n    for (int row = 0; row < s; ++row) {\n        const int* values = matrix[row].data();\n        #pragma omp simd\n        for (int col = 0; col < n; ++col)\n            column[col] += static_cast<Sum>(values[col]);\n    }\n\n    Sum first = 0;\n    #pragma omp simd reduction(+:first)\n    for (int col = 0; col < s; ++col)\n        first += column[col];\n\n    Sum best = first;\n    const int last = n - s;\n    for (int top = 0; top <= last; ++top) {\n        best = horizontal_maximum(column, n, s, first, best);\n\n        if (top == last)\n            break;\n\n        const int* outgoing = matrix[top].data();\n        const int* incoming = matrix[top + s].data();\n        Sum first_delta = 0;\n        #pragma omp simd reduction(+:first_delta)\n        for (int col = 0; col < s; ++col) {\n            const Sum delta = static_cast<Sum>(incoming[col])\n                            - static_cast<Sum>(outgoing[col]);\n            column[col] += delta;\n            first_delta += delta;\n        }\n        first += first_delta;\n\n        #pragma omp simd\n        for (int col = s; col < n; ++col) {\n            column[col] += static_cast<Sum>(incoming[col])\n                         - static_cast<Sum>(outgoing[col]);\n        }\n    }\n\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", static_cast<int>(best));\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "path": "src/solution.cpp"
    }
  ],
  "hypothesis": "Eight-window ARM64 NEON prefix scans can shorten the horizontal sum/max dependency chains to one carry update per block.",
